{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To The Skies</strong> is a fast-paced aerial racing game where you fly your surfboard through spectacular environments, chaining tricks and carving tight turns to build boost and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Race!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/RacingOverview.gif?t=1749121549\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by arcade greats like <i>Wipeout</i>, <i>SSX Tricky</i>, and <i>Pilotwings</i>, <i>To The Skies</i> blends high-speed racing with expressive movement. Each course challenges you to master the skies \u2014 from sunlit cloudscapes to stormy cityscapes \u2014 with dynamic obstacles, branching paths, and opportunities for big-air stunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tricks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/SteamAboutSummersault2E.gif?t=1749121549\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform spins, flips, and board grabs to regain boost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Special Moves</strong>! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/SteamAboutSharpLeft.gif?t=1749121549\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master unique tricks like 180s to navigate faster and open up new lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Campaign Mode</strong>:Take on skill-based challenges to unlock new courses, tricks, board upgrades, and cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Dynamic Soundtrack</strong>: A high-energy 